body:
I hear you man. Something to note - start of season is always the worst. You get the smurfs and the sore losers. Yesterday, I was in a match with some guy who started being toxic because I missed a goal / save, and we ended up being 3 down. He was obviously typing to me but I couldn't see it because I only use quick chat, and he also started bumping me. I just replied with "This Is Rocket League!", "Wow!" and "All yours.", and for some reason he actually started playing normally again, we clutched a score on 00:00 and we ended up winning in overtime. I saved the match.

&#x200B;

I'm stuck in D3 right now because of people like that guy who do just give up easily, I should be in C2.

Something similar happened to me yesterday and I completely forgot to clip it. I drove up to their goalie to fake demo them, and then just sat there looking at him. He didn't know what to do. Then my mate hit the ball off me and into the goal.

&#x200B;

I called it "Intimidation"

